  "methodology_notes": "Three-pronged approach: (1) Landscape mapping identified 12.2M mobile cloud gaming users from market research; (2) Service-specific analysis estimated 17-27.5M by aggregating individual platforms; (3) Regional analysis calculated 27.7-46.35M by geography. Final estimate uses weighted average: 20% weight to landscape (single source, potentially undercounted), 40% to services (medium confidence), 40% to regional (broader coverage). Result: 18-35M range with 27M mid-point, representing 0.6-1.8% of 2.85B mobile gamers (1.2% mid-point). Confidence: MEDIUM (±30% margin) due to definition variance, service non-disclosure, and geographic gaps particularly in China and emerging markets.",
